承担责任，但不认可吕女士的第三方检测结果。","type":1}]},{"desc":"第三方检测","timestamp":264000,"detail":"","points":[{"desc":"・双方检测结论截然相反","detail":"1. 车行检测结果：委托的第三方机构判定车辆左后纵梁完好，仅车身覆盖件有局部修复，不属于事故车，且认为吕女士的检测存在误判。\n2. 争议僵局：双方对检测结果各执一词，未达成一致意见。","type":1}]},{"desc":"投诉与处理","timestamp":308500,"detail":"","points":[{"desc":"・维权遭遇多部门推诿","detail":"1. 部门推诿：石羊街道市监所称归商务局处理，商务文旅局称若属消费欺诈归市监局，市监局推给消协，综治中心表示仅能调解，欺诈需主管部门界定。\n2. 后续计划：吕女士表示将通过司法渠道继续维护自身权益。","type":1}]}],"chapter_recommend_type":1,"chapter_abstract":"林女士夫妇信任百万粉丝主播庞勇，购买了一辆二手车。后发现车辆存在问题，经检测为事故车。双方检测报告存在争议，车行负责人黄玲表示若鉴定为事故车，原价回购，若隐瞒则一赔三。吕女士投诉无果，将寻求司法渠道维权。","chapter_recommend_source":2,"push_scene":[],"chapter_bar_color":null},"trends_infos":null,"chapter_bar_color":null,"flash_mob_trends":0,"ent_log_extra":{"log_extra":"{\"global_log_extra\":null,\"page_log_extra\":null,\"aweme_log_extra\":{\"ce_current_group_id\":\"7616318506246528458\",\"author_id\":\"62596527221\"},\"extra_log_extra\":null}"},"personal_page_botton_diagnose_style":0,"aweme_type_tags":""},{"aweme_id":"7616317157839785216","desc":"分期乐优惠套餐暗藏套路，消费者要退款先签 “闭嘴函”！ #998新闻调查 直击消费陷阱，捍卫合法权益！#315   #分期乐 #直击消费陷阱  #优惠券  #消费者权益","create_time":1773312038,"author":{"uid":"62596527221","interest_tags":null,"nickname":"成都新闻广播","card_sort_priority":null,"user_tags":null,"avatar_thumb":{"uri":"100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_6ec11be2704e1f1bdbfa9d4c1d4c4cb3","url_list":["https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_6ec11be2704e1f1bdbfa9d4c1d4c4cb3.jpeg?from=327834062"],"width":720,"height":720},"private_relation_list":null,"endorsement_info_list":null,"follow_status":0,"special_people_labels":null,"hide_self_recommend_interest":0,"familiar_visitor_user":null,"custom_verify":"","display_info":null,"card_entries_not_display":null,"user_permissions":null,"profile_component_disabled":null,"ban_user_functions":null,"share_info":{"share_url":"","share_weibo_desc":"","share_desc":"","share_title":"","share_qrcode_url":{"uri":"67180024d558b2178ade","url_list":["https://p3-pc-